GnomeAgentBuddy includes code ported from Coucou (https://github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou):

  - relay/agentbuddy_hook.py: the per-agent event and field normalisation and the
    reply formats (windows/hook/src/normalize.rs, reply.rs, main.rs)
  - lib/hookInstaller.js: the hook configuration formats and the merge and
    uninstall rules (windows/src-tauri/src/hooks.rs, agents.rs)

